## Help

- Questions and problems: feedback@dynamical.org, or the repositories at https://github.com/dynamical-org.

## Optional

- [Catalog](https://dynamical.org/catalog/): the human-readable catalog, with runnable examples and notebooks on each dataset page.
- [Prompts for AI agents](https://dynamical.org/agents/): what a person pastes into an assistant to point it here.
- [Pipeline status](https://dynamical.org/status/pipeline/): per-run timing and upstream arrival history; [status](https://dynamical.org/status/) for uptime.
- [Weather station scorecard](https://dynamical.org/scorecard/): forecast accuracy against US weather stations; per-dataset validation reports are the `about` links in each collection.
